  "details": "Having the Horizon Adjust on when in half-body (Not full body), adjusting, and then changing the world positions you as if you were to turn on the seated play mode.\n\n1. Open VRChat in PC VR with only HMD + 2 controllers. (NO full body as I didn't test this)\n\n2. Turn on Horizon Adjust and adjust yourself to a different position.\n\n3. Adjust your position in your play space by either using Play Space Mover in OVR Advanced Settings or by physically moving. \n\n    - To make this most pronounced, play space down towards the VRChat ground\n\n3. Change world. \n\n    - You will notice as the world fades to black your character jumps up to a standing position.\n\n    - As you move around in your new world, you will notice that if you try and change your position in your place space you will jump to the same height position as when you joined.",
